  "body": "Follow-up from the delta review of PR #3171 (#3169), comment 7064408388.\n\n1. The sweep skips a symlink or junction at the `build/<package>` level, but no test pins that level.\n2. The process check folds case only on Windows. On a case-insensitive macOS volume, a process that names the root with other case is not matched.\n3. No real run of the PowerShell or `ps` process check exists yet on Linux and macOS: confirm with one gate run on each.\n",
